<p>NOTE: The company's net loss for its third fiscal quarter of 1997 includes a $6.9 million restructuring charge. Excluding the one-time charge, net loss for the third quarter 1997 was $12.3 million or $0.42 per unit, compared to a net loss of $10.6 million or $0.36 per unit in the year-ago quarter. Excluding the one-timne charge, EBITDA for the third quarter of 1997 was $5.3 million, versus EBITDA for the comparable 1996 quarter of $5.7 million.</p>
